codex
The invariant is: starting a loop with accumulator `A` and remaining sequence `VS`, fixed execution ends with accumulator `A + totalLen(VS)`. The base is the empty sequence; the step adds the current element’s semantic `len` and recurs on the tail. I’m encoding that as a circularity plus two entry claims (`<=` and `>`) so the tie-first behavior is explicit.
apply patch
